{
  "note": "Mihara: Bonding Chain \u2014 MG/Fire. Restraint dump gated to her own Full Burst end; S2 Ensnaring generation does NOT consume Restraint (2026-08-21). Ensnaring Chains is modeled as a LIVE stack pool.\nRESTRAINT CHAINS: a live resource `restraint` [0..10], initial 10, recharged to 10 at the end of her own Full Burst, and consumed at 0.4s per stack over 4s. Each consumption deals 50.06% damage and adds +1 Ensnaring stack.\nS2 STACK GENERATION: after 40 normal attacks during Full Burst on an Ensnared target, Ensnaring stacks \u25b2 1. This does NOT consume Restraint and does NOT deal the 50.06% dump damage.\nBURST: Dragging Chain mirrors 20 Ensnaring stacks (1001%/s) for 10s and cancels Ensnaring.",
