  "caveats": [
    "skill1: Restraint Chains are a live resource (restraint [0..10]). They recharge to 10 at the end of HER OWN Full Burst only (ownBurstGate:'cast') and are consumed over 4s (0.4s per stack), each consumption dealing 50.06% damage and adding +1 Ensnaring.",
    "skill2: after 40 normal attacks during Full Burst on an Ensnared target, Ensnaring stacks +1. This does NOT consume Restraint and does NOT deal the 50.06% S1 dump damage.",
    "skill1: the permanent Ensnaring DoT is LIVE \u2014 perResource {ensnaring, 25.08} recomputes each tick from the current stack count.",
    "skill2: the 40-normals-in-Full-Burst Ensnaring generation carries fbGate:\"inFb\" AND countScope:\"gated\".",
    "skill1: the 0.4s/stack dump cadence is the measured 'specific timing'; it is currently omitted at battle start (initial 10 restraint sits until her first own-FB end), which is a minor first-cycle undercount in long fights.",
    "skill2: incapacitated +20 and enemy-neutralized +1 lines are inert at scope lock."
